WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.250
Lab 2 uses a ring 0 test device in
a test tenant, never production,

2
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:08.288
with the policies assigned and
network protection in audit.

3
00:00:08.288 --> 00:00:11.387
On the device, collect
its state, elevated.

4
00:00:11.387 --> 00:00:15.237
On your workstation, sign in and
run the prevention check live.

5
00:00:15.237 --> 00:00:18.343
Then test network protection
the way Learn does:

6
00:00:18.343 --> 00:00:21.525
in a browser other than
Edge, open Learn's test site.

7
00:00:21.525 --> 00:00:25.895
In audit mode the site opens
and event 1125 is logged;

8
00:00:25.895 --> 00:00:29.350
in block mode it's
blocked, with event 1126.

9
00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:34.038
Run the check again the next day, and the
audited event appears in the events file.

10
00:00:34.038 --> 00:00:35.950
Nothing changed on the device.
